      "text": "Under Article 94(a) of the Labor Code, every worker must receive his regular daily wage on a regular holiday, unless the employer is a retail or service establishment that regularly employs fewer than ten workers. If the repair shop employs ten or more employees, the closure of the premises does not eliminate the holiday‑pay entitlement.",
