      "text": "The Omnibus Rules (Section 9(a)) state that a regular holiday that falls on an employee’s scheduled rest day must still be compensated. Article 94(a) further requires holiday pay for all workers, except retail or service establishments with fewer than ten workers. Thus, unless the repair business falls within that exemption, closing on the holiday does not remove the pay obligation.",
